{"id":"46ef8d04be945789","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-finite-index-extra-data.md","title":"有限特征索引加基数或最大元可恢复完整代码","display":"thm-finite-index-extra-data — 有限特征索引加基数或最大元可恢复完整代码","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-finite-index-extra-data","aliases":["20-thm-finite-index-extra-data"],"display":"thm-finite-index-extra-data — 有限特征索引加基数或最大元可恢复完整代码","chapter":"2","section":"2.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.3.13","source_printed_pages":[37],"source_pdf_pages":[73],"depends_on":["[[20-df-characteristic-indices]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-finite-index-extra-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-finite-index-extra-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-index-extra-data — 有限特征索引加基数或最大元可恢复完整代码"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.3.13"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>37</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3850151d9f29cbf4\" href=\"?note=3850151d9f29cbf4\" title=\"20-df-characteristic-indices\">20-df-characteristic-indices</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(F\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 有限；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CharInd}(i,F)\">\\(\\operatorname{CharInd}(i,F)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=|F|\">\\(k=|F|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\max(F\\cup\\{0\\})\">\\(m=\\max(F\\cup\\{0\\})\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3850151d9f29cbf4\" href=\"?note=3850151d9f29cbf4\" title=\"20-df-characteristic-indices\">20-df-characteristic-indices</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}index\\text{-}extra\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\exists a,b\\in\\mathcal C_2\\ \\forall F,i,k,m\\ \\bigl[(|F|&lt;\\omega\\land\\operatorname{CharInd}(i,F)\\land k=|F|\\land m=\\max(F\\cup\\{0\\}))\\Rightarrow a(i,k)\\downarrow=\\operatorname{fcode}(F)\\land b(i,m)\\downarrow=\\operatorname{fcode}(F)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}index\\text{-}extra\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\exists a,b\\in\\mathcal C_2\\ \\forall F,i,k,m\\ \\bigl[(|F|&lt;\\omega\\land\\operatorname{CharInd}(i,F)\\land k=|F|\\land m=\\max(F\\cup\\{0\\}))\\Rightarrow a(i,k)\\downarrow=\\operatorname{fcode}(F)\\land b(i,m)\\downarrow=\\operatorname{fcode}(F)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>a 顺次运行特征程序，发现 k 个肯定成员后输出代码；k=0 时直接给 0。b 只检查 0,…,m 并编码肯定成员。完整代码本身又给出基数和 max(F∪{0})。a,b 仅要求部分可计算，因为无 promise 的特征程序可能发散或基数错误。默认最大元取 0 消除空集边界。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.3.13；印刷页 37；PDF 第 73 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-characteristic-indices","status":"resolved","id":"3850151d9f29cbf4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic-indices]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic-indices","status":"resolved","id":"3850151d9f29cbf4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic-indices]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic-indices]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic-indices]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CharInd}(i,F)","display":false},{"tex":"k=|F|","display":false},{"tex":"m=\\max(F\\cup\\{0\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}index\\text{-}extra\\text{-}data}\\vdash\n\\exists a,b\\in\\mathcal C_2\\ \\forall F,i,k,m\\ \\bigl[(|F|<\\omega\\land\\operatorname{CharInd}(i,F)\\land k=|F|\\land m=\\max(F\\cup\\{0\\}))\\Rightarrow a(i,k)\\downarrow=\\operatorname{fcode}(F)\\land b(i,m)\\downarrow=\\operatorname{fcode}(F)\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1656,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["3850151d9f29cbf4","59004ac6d23e86f8","e343870c773cb68e"]}